NOTES

  - This is a concept prototype for discussion. It is not an official
    publication of the East African Community and is not affiliated with,
    endorsed by, or connected to the EAC, its organs, or its partner states.
  - Country figures, scorecard values, tracker entries and AI-assistant
    answers in the site are illustrative and synthetic.
  - The flag map (assets/logo.png) is composed of the national flags of the
    EAC partner states; those flags are the property of their respective
    states and are used here for identification and illustration only.
